      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAW UMBER (1) led and won in impressive fashion in this class last time out, breaking his maiden in impressive fashion. Pike remains on board and the rise in trip doesn't look an issue. Ticks plenty of boxes here and he can repeat the dose in what looks a suitable race. ROCKTEX (5) flew home to miss narrowly first-up before tackling a 1300m at Pinjarra just 6 days ago, missing out by 0.5L in a good performance. On the quick turnaround here, but he rates highly on the latest effort. Should get every chance. AXOPAR (6) draws the inside today after a 1.9L defeat at Pinjarra last start. Fiore rides now as she's building into the campaign nicely. She can play a leading role. KEGS AND LEGS (3) finds a suitable race for his debut. Can feature. CHIX OBSESSION (2) won't be far away with the rise in trip looking to suit.",
